---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Discord Asset Sizes (2026): Official Dimensions Guide" 
  description="Verified Discord asset size guide for 2026. Exact pixel dimensions, file size limits, formats, and Nitro/Boost requirements for all creator assets."
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#3b82f6]/10 text-[#3b82f6] text-xs font-semibold border border-[#3b82f6]/20 mb-4">
        Updated for 2026 Platform Releases
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Discord Asset Sizes & Dimension Cheat Sheet
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#9da6b8] text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Every official dimension, byte boundary, supported format, and permission requirement for Discord creator assets—verified directly against Discord Help Center and Developer documentation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Reference Table -->
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-[12px] border border-[#2b313e] bg-[#15181e] mb-16">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-[#1c2028] text-xs uppercase text-[#9da6b8] border-b border-[#2b313e]">
          <tr>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4">Asset Type</th>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4">Required Dimensions</th>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4">Max File Size</th>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4">Supported Formats</th>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4">Gating / Requirement</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#2b313e] text-[#f0f2f5]">
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Global Profile Banner</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">Min 680 × 240</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs">10 MB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG, Animated GIF</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#f59e0b]/10 text-[#f59e0b] border border-[#f59e0b]/20">Discord Nitro</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Per-Server Profile Banner</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">Min 600 × 240</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs">10 MB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG, Animated GIF</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#f59e0b]/10 text-[#f59e0b] border border-[#f59e0b]/20">Discord Nitro</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Server Banner</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">960 × 540 (16:9)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs">10 MB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG, GIF</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#3b82f6]/10 text-[#3b82f6] border border-[#3b82f6]/20">Boost L2 (Static) / L3 (Animated)</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Custom Emoji</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">128 × 128 (32x32 view)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#ef4444]">256 KiB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG, GIF, WEBP</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs">Server Emoji Slots</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Custom Sticker</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">Exactly 320 × 320</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#ef4444]">512 KiB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG (Static) / APNG (Anim)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs">Max 5s duration & 60 FPS</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Avatar / PFP</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">512 × 512 (1:1)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs">8 MB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG, GIF</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs">Nitro for animated</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Role Icon</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">Exactly 64 × 64</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#ef4444]">256 KB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#3b82f6]/10 text-[#3b82f6] border border-[#3b82f6]/20">Boost L2 + Manage Roles</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#1c2028]/50">
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Server Invite Background</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-[#3b82f6]">Exactly 1920 × 1080</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono text-xs">10 MB</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs text-[#9da6b8]">PNG, JPG (GIF unsupported)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-xs"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#3b82f6]/10 text-[#3b82f6] border border-[#3b82f6]/20">Boost Level 1</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Detailed Section Guides -->
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <div class="bg-[#15181e] p-8 rounded-[12px] border border-[#2b313e]">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">1. Server Banner Safe Zone & Readability Guidance</h2>
        <p class="text-[#9da6b8] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Discord officially specifies that the <strong>top 48 pixels</strong> of a server banner are partially overlaid by the server title and navigation UI on desktop clients. Keep critical artwork, logos, and typography below this 48px boundary to avoid awkward visual obstruction.
        </p>
        <a href="/tools/banner" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-[#3b82f6] hover:underline">
          Open Banner Studio with live safe zone overlay →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#15181e] p-8 rounded-[12px] border border-[#2b313e]">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">2. The 256 KiB vs 256 KB Boundary on Custom Emojis</h2>
        <p class="text-[#9da6b8] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Discord's backend enforces a strict binary kilobyte limit: <strong>256 KiB (262,144 bytes)</strong>. Files that are 257,000 bytes will fail upload even though some operating systems report them as "256 KB" using decimal prefixes. Discord Asset Studio measures the exact encoded Blob byte length in memory before allowing download.
        </p>
        <a href="/tools/emoji" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-[#3b82f6] hover:underline">
          Format & compress emojis to 256 KiB now →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#15181e] p-8 rounded-[12px] border border-[#2b313e]">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Custom Stickers: APNG vs GIF</h2>
        <p class="text-[#9da6b8] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Discord custom stickers must be <strong>exactly 320x320 pixels</strong> and under <strong>512 KiB (524,288 bytes)</strong>. For animated stickers, Discord recommends Animated PNG (APNG) with a maximum duration of 5 seconds and up to 60 frames per second. While developer documentation mentions Lottie files, standard user and server uploads rely on APNG.
        </p>
        <a href="/tools/sticker" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-[#3b82f6] hover:underline">
          Format stickers to exact 320x320 specifications →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
